("table", ["Sign", "Example"], [["Change in state", "Candle wax melts, vaporises and burns to give carbon dioxide and water vapour"], ["Change in colour", "Lemon juice added to purple potassium permanganate solution makes it colourless"], ["Evolution of a gas", "Zinc granules with dilute sulphuric acid give bubbles of hydrogen"], ["Formation of a precipitate", "Sodium sulphate solution + barium chloride solution give white barium sulphate"], ["Change in temperature", "Quicklime added to water makes the mixture hot"]]),
